      "content": "thanks for that. i get the basic flow, but i'm having a hard time with the acoustics part. when the turbo is at high boost, there's this really specific, piercing high-pitched whistle or a sort of howling sound coming from it. is that just standard air turbulence, or is it a mechanical resonance issue? what exactly is causing that sound to be so loud and distinct?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
